  m_text: This is a game named supermarket simulator about supermarket simulation
    where you are able to play in supermarket simulation where you must be the supermarket
    owner and do everything for your supermarket clients. Supermarket is very important
    and you must do everything to develop your own supermarket for more customers
    come in your supermarket to give you more money using which you will be able
    to buy more new products for your supermarket and more customers will come to
    your supermarket to give you more money using which you will be able to buy more
    new products for your supermarket and more customers will come to your supermarket
